xMCGAS molecule
runs a gas-phase MC for a molecule -
it makes a subdirectory molecule.gas
and runs the MC there. The T is 25 C.
If a different T is needed, the gaspar file must be edited.
This is the companion gas-phase simulation for the pure liquid
simulation with flexible liquid molecules.
e.g.,
xMCGAS etoh
